,"jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_21","text":"... Oh, sorry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_22","text":"The smell brought me back. That's all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_23","text":"Back when Grave was still a researcher.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_24","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_24","text":"Can you tell me more?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_25","text":"Of course. What wonderful days those were...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["abe"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_26","text":"Once a week, we would have a counseling session with Grave.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Laboratory","bgArt":"laboratory","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_marrybad","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_27","text":"She would see how we were doing mentally and physically,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_28","text":"and monitor whether there were any changes in our skill level.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_29","text":"We would talk about how we could improve going forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_30","text":"This was usually done via a battery of tests,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_31","text":"and we would discuss the results afterwards.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_32","text":"If the tests went on for a long time and we missed dinner,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_33","text":"Grave would cook soup for us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_34","text":"She'd ask me to eat up so that I stayed in good health.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_35","text":"Meanwhile, she'd take only the tiniest helping for herself and head straight back to her desk, working without a break.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_36","text":"I would sit in the back of the lab and drink the soup Grave had made for us,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_37","text":"staring at her back as she worked.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_38","text":"I can still remember how beautiful she looked, so immersed in her research.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_39","text":"I couldn't take my eyes off her. I often thought about how it was her stunning passion that allowed her to create us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_40","text":"Sometimes, I'd get lost in her,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["littlemermaid"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_41","text":"and Siren would come looking for me because I hadn't returned to the dorm.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_42","text":"I'd ask her to sit down next to me, and I'd share the soup with her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_43","text":"Before long, Hansel and Gretel would come sniffing around and ask for some as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["hansel","gretel"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_44","text":"Inevitably, we'd end up getting too rowdy","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_45","text":"and Grave would turn around to admonish us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_46","text":"She'd berate me for giving away the soup to the others when she'd made it for me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_47","text":"Then she'd go right ahead and make some more for everyone else,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_48","text":"grumbling all the while about how we were burning through supplies too quickly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_49","text":"Haha, those were such good times...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"land_d","bgArt":"land_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_50","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_cinderella_04_51","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_cinderella_04_51","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ci